  "chapter_readings": [
    {
      "text": "Maya takes a flashlight, and Tom takes some yellow cheese. They go to the big tree in the garden. Tom shines the flashlight under the roots. A little mouse comes out of a hole with a book in its little paws. “We have cheese. Do you have a key?” asks Tom. The mouse gives them a silver key, takes the cheese and disappears. Under the leaves, the children find an old door in the ground.",
      "start_ms": 6428,
